Hey there,

This is bold text, and underlined is quite nice too. What about italic?

This is regular size. Larger now. Slightly smaller. Smaller. Regular again. 
Very small. Tiny.

Wow and what about emoji? 🙂😉😛

Heading 1

That’s a big one. Here’s a link <https://allodia.eu/>  by the way.

And also different colors are nice to play with.

What about a different font? Famous Comic Sans!

Here’s a list.

*	Bullet item 1
1.	Numbered list nested inside it
2.	Second numbered list item
3.	Third one
*	Bullet item 2
*	Bullet item 3

Indentation also works!
Indented even further.

Now back to normal.

Even centered text works!

Here’s an inline image:



And a small table:


Heading 1
Heading 2

Row 2, first cell
Row 2, second cell

  _____


Wow that’s a horizontal line right above me.

Kind regards,
Alice
This is my bold signature, pretty cool right?



